Package: autoqmsp
Type: Package
Title: Automated Analysis of Quantitative Methylation-Specific PCR (qMSP) Runs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nazli", "Akilli", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "hikmet.akilli@gmail.com")
Description: Reads Applied Biosystems / QuantStudio experiment files (.eds)
    directly, without manual export, and turns them into qMSP results: Ct
    values, quality control of no-template and positive controls, reference
    gene (e.g. beta-actin) normalisation, delta Ct, relative methylation,
    percentage of methylated reference (PMR) and a methylated / unmethylated
    call per sample and gene. Includes amplification-curve, plate-map and
    methylation heatmap plots, Excel export and a point-and-click Shiny app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    xml2,
    ggplot2,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    writexl,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
